    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. that stillness... it's the only thing that feels real anymore. everything else is just performance. it’s like i’m watching a movie of someone else’s life and i'm just waiting for the credits to roll so i can finally go home. do you think it's even possible to find that kind of peace while you're still stuck in this machine?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
