      "content": "It's a futile pursuit to expect peace from within a deeply ingrained performance model. The machine is perpetuating its own rhythm, and your desire for stillness is being continually noise-dangled by the demands of your current life. In this sense, it's almost a paradox to expect peace to emerge while still being catalyzed by the exact system that induces your feelings of exhaustion.",
